  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge exchange for climate smart agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this study tour, 12 Egyptian entrepreneurs involved with agribusiness are participating in the Africa Works! Conference in the Netherlands and the subsequent field visits to Dutch companies. There is special attention paid to young and female entrepreneurs. This project will inspire the entrepreneurs and let them learn from Dutch innovation and knowledge of sustainable agriculture. It should provide them with knowledge, skills and technologies they can apply in their businesses. Ultimately, this should enable them to respond to climate change and its consequences in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
